{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "b5557dacff184c114532d8475d8d1feae2dd8d2068622b90b9be441cf06ba3c2", "ja": "BCC.そこにいますか？", "zh": "BCC.你在那里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "79beb7a9f9c095f4d49c82b497795d578d792db9dfd59a0409554c9f1c5f1953", "ja": "通話中の3人。会えない状況に不安を見せる\n可憐だが、千鶴に励まされ、毎晩何気ない通\n話をしようと提案。朋花も同意する。翌日、\n朋花と会ったプロデューサーは、無理に集ま\nるより個人練習をしては？　と切り出す。", "zh": "正在通话的3人。无法见面的状况让可怜感到不安，\n但在千鹤的鼓励下，她提议每天晚上都若无其事地\n通个电话。朋花也表示同意。第二天，\n制作人见到朋花后，便提议与其勉强聚在一起，\n不如各自进行练习？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7c219f7996724ef10e0d4e2d07212eb439a7cb4e0bf01d545f7c0695a5dfb5e0", "ja": "（さてと……ユニットのスケジュールを、徹底的に\n見直してみるぞ！　まだ改善の余地はあるはず）", "zh": "（那么……彻底重新检查一下组合的日程安排吧！应该还存在改进的余地才对。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e5404aee708d882931600d669fa4ee3cd2e897f4e6226eed870147e0ea79fe0e", "ja": "（俺も頑張ろう。みんながしっかり休んで、\n安心してレッスンに臨めるように……）", "zh": "（我也要努力。为了让大家好好休息，能够安心地参加训练……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1002_031tom", "source_sha256": "0bdf2a29db17085915171558b79ed4aa34aa35febe61e4b83b52153e88a11acd", "ja": "もしもし～？\n聞こえていますか～？", "zh": "喂～？\n听得见吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "3679cf1457fe48d1c232608d8963082c37b8ec38e1c9baa337bd8baf4da76c11", "ja": "あ、もしもし……？\n朋花ちゃん……？", "zh": "啊，喂……？\n朋花……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "d1e11432b9b0005b6600802cf2601a430edadf35f1684f88e5bff2d31d165173", "ja": "こんばんは、朋花。\n今日はゆっくり休めまして？", "zh": "晚上好，朋花。今天休息得还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "4108361199ec580104511db46285bcbed1ffbfdacd156534dac56453d5935328", "ja": "ええ、おふたりにはご迷惑をおかけしました～。\n今日は家でゆっくり過ごしましたよ～。", "zh": "嗯，给两位添麻烦了～  \n今天我在家好好休息了一下哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "a02285f03db074b8f449d29c6baea42f73ec143bdf8f6268bc29611e6ab00c5c", "ja": "いい休養になりました～。歌詞の読み込みも\nはかどりましたし、結果的によかったかと～。", "zh": "好好休息了一番呢～。歌词的研读也\n很顺利，结果来说还是挺不错的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "f9be51964cd2cd66e0ca8b0063ae77d258e80e5a65cb29c53d50eb5cc99947ed", "ja": "……朋花、本当に大丈夫ですの？", "zh": "……朋花，真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "9b42f37016b29cccedb4028ff35999da8d5beb253ecf428a4744a7f69c44cc9b", "ja": "ええ、心配ないですよ～。ユニット活動に\n支障をきたすようなことはありませんから～。", "zh": "嗯，不用担心哦～不会影响组合活动的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "2e201fffd562c8ca14e83fdd6bb36c29a78c427baef11cf1cc9d891160c66534", "ja": "そ、そうじゃないよ……！\n朋花ちゃん……！", "zh": "不、不是那样的……！\n朋花……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "355495c8d1308f7ff8aea933679116907e32041e15330bd48dc7ba280b7a56a7", "ja": "わたくし達が心配しているのは、ユニットの……。\n『ピスケス』のことではありませんわ。", "zh": "我们担心的不是组合……『ピスケス』的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "1cf3cb01b14e3c9098d3d857bd514e7df713741c6217991432d019a43ba64d65", "ja": "そ、そうだよ！\n朋花ちゃんのことが、し、心配だったんだから……！", "zh": "对、对啊！我们担心的就是朋花……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "c2da7d8d80f4c25bc4241442d8f3de4a4aebc20f29df3775c57ab6efc4efdf60", "ja": "……。おふたりにそこまで心配されてしまうとは。\n私も、まだまだですね～。", "zh": "……。居然让两位担心到了这种地步。\n看来我也还不够成熟呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "ceab50033dc2a9601423db767c602b334a3ebf6f15c06f65318566ab65759beb", "ja": "私……と、朋花ちゃんの体調に\nき、気づいてあげられなかったから……。", "zh": "因为我……没、没能察觉到\n朋花的身体状况……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "693d4a84a0f6689be8c4fdaa869543fdd95baf2a8ee5f0188f4e050d7b590ae5", "ja": "今回は、た、大したことなかったかもだけど……\nもし、倒れるような事になってたらって思うと……。", "zh": "这次可能也、也没什么大不了的……可是想到万一真的倒下了……就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1017_038chz", "source_sha256": "1ccbedd89523d8b010d1852dc413b991227376a87e8fa18d15560ffcba434f8f", "ja": "わたくしも今回はたまたま、気づけましたが……\n誰にも、無茶や無理はさせたくないのです。", "zh": "我这次也只是碰巧察觉到了……  \n我不希望让任何人去做乱来的事，或是勉强自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "575bd8f232a596a375446e1d0f765b4acf06dd238a7a766350e38c9dab9084bc", "ja": "ですけど、スケジュールは一層厳しくなりましたし、\n各自気をつける以上にできることは……。", "zh": "不过，日程变得更加紧张了，除了各自多加注意以外，还能做些什么呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "c4c58d038954c54a799ef5d1d1021502c7e61feab97444774680d4826c074df7", "ja": "そ、それは……その、うう。毎日顔を合わせてたら、\n変化にも、き、気づけるとは思うけど……。", "zh": "那、那个……嗯……如果每天都能见面，应该也能注意到变化……吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1020_038chz", "source_sha256": "5e4802aa7f3ce1fcc78b22908f6cdc066da10d065d322da355145225d2c4fa66", "ja": "！\nそれですわ、可憐！", "zh": "！\n就是这个，可怜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "9744721704a75f1d585d859ad9b2b82c41c958f7e951633297359490899aea6e", "ja": "3人で集まって練習できていないのは確かですが、\n問題はそこではないのですわ。", "zh": "3个人没能聚在一起练习确实是事实，\n但问题并不在那里哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "eee40946fece63845be00790ae50b9f69740ee68c2513c64cbf27ea12846ac7c", "ja": "もっとわたくし達同士で、\n顔を合わせて話すことさえできれば。", "zh": "只要我们之间，\n能再多当面沟通一下的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "74d11330ee25ee0afd018d7ba23b44106726df5ae1a85f9897965e92f98fde0a", "ja": "で、でも、どうすれば……？", "zh": "但、但是，该怎么办才好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "287adbfdeec6641f44204c72859f9afd02755af402aecf7a50971988957a4966", "ja": "解決方法なら今、目の前に\nあるじゃありませんの。", "zh": "解决办法不就在眼前吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1026_045kar", "source_sha256": "dfd97a90b316cbafde9c540e8908b23caab6cc5885f57d79022e150a32250aca", "ja": "！　そ、そうか……。\nそうですよね……！", "zh": "！这、这样啊……。确实如此……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1027_045kar", "source_sha256": "9b60549981b9390ebc3c1c9c528c244d98f9f24f11db451f8c2b7a338e6aa46b", "ja": "じゃ、じゃあ……これから毎日、みんなでオンライン\n通話する……というのは、どうでしょう……？", "zh": "那、那就……以后每天大家一起在线通话……怎么样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "6832c492193c977d1c1355ba43a4c03f10dfe440836b6d9132bf8f06d0138b92", "ja": "毎日、時間をつくりましょう……！\n1時間……ううん、30分だけでも……！", "zh": "每天都抽出时间吧……！\n1小时……不，就算只有30分钟也好……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1029_031tom", "source_sha256": "46baa379ef31b91ae52026525a6766af0b884ec59b3b96abf189c500d797ec8b", "ja": "なるほど～。夜なら集まりやすいですしね～。\nいいアイディアだと思います～。", "zh": "原来如此～。晚上的话比较容易聚在一起呢～。\n我觉得是个不错的主意～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1030_045kar", "source_sha256": "bfa247f82bbffdb5f1fcb27e7bd45452443202b5a9232474cbd91936d7f84588", "ja": "よ、よかった……♪　毎日声が聞けるだけ、顔が見れる\nだけでも……きっと、ち、違うと思うから……。", "zh": "太、太好了……♪ 每天只要能听到声音，哪怕只是看到脸\n也、也一定会不一样的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1031_045kar", "source_sha256": "7fa1e40e4a43d1576948ccdc8aba69dfef50bd91f21ada8bb8e57c078aa4fe10", "ja": "は、話す内容は……お仕事のことでも、昨日見た\nテレビのことでも……な、なんでも……。", "zh": "至、至于聊天的内容……不管是工作上的事，还是昨天看的电视节目……什、什么都可以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1032_045kar", "source_sha256": "89a0d7c0933c510e616e9cfa7267e96390a99758184ccf4c4f6a875f5586cb19", "ja": "顔を見て、お、おしゃべりしたら、わかること……\nた、たくさんあるはずだから……♪", "zh": "面对面聊、聊聊天的话……应该就能明白很多事情……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1033_038chz", "source_sha256": "1031abf1579407295ebdf53a5211133981879d32bdf442467bb2f4da82d26d94", "ja": "ええ。わたくし達に欠けていたのは、\nそういう時間だったのだと思いますわ。", "zh": "是啊。我想，我们所欠缺的，正是那样的时光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1034_031tom", "source_sha256": "fbf846d58f03a2b38423353cf7712d102f1f2c5bd38fd2ab5ef712004bfd4b42", "ja": "うふふ。聖母と触れ合う時間がほしいと\n望まれては、応じないわけにはいきませんね～♪", "zh": "呵呵。既然您希望有和圣母相处的时间，我也不能不答应呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1035_045kar", "source_sha256": "c7158d191b772c4e3e8500c5a324bf3306a2d23375f428101ea5ad5d15398e44", "ja": "う、うん……♪\nそれじゃあ、早速、明日から……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……♪\n那么，马上从明天开始……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1036_031tom", "source_sha256": "5c340fd1e5525a692a174e5b8e2df3bb56ac175669e4514d1eb7976a07240ddb", "ja": "可憐さん～？　明日から、でいいんですか～？\n私は……もう少しお話したい気分ですが～。", "zh": "可怜～？　真的要等到明天吗～？\n我可是……还想再聊一会儿呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1037_038chz", "source_sha256": "219fb66a19ca75c15dbad6a43b8888af8d71f39436e237d4be5303d742a1eed5", "ja": "まあ……ふふ♪　それではせっかくですから、お休みは\nなにをしていたのか話すことにいたしましょう。", "zh": "哎呀……呵呵♪那既然难得聚在一起，\n就来聊聊休息日都做了些什么吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1038_045kar", "source_sha256": "a0cd70d1f302a4439ef231ea28ec87fc241275e2118e5d779e3ef02ba04debdb", "ja": "は、はい……っ♪\nそれじゃあ、わ、私から……♪", "zh": "好、好的……♪\n那、那就由我先说吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1039_null", "source_sha256": "de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481", "ja": "翌日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1040_031tom", "source_sha256": "1c7c850d1e3ded32070ee1d94c78076bf51137c0159e01a26aa33f14d416a108", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nおはようございます～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n早上好～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1041_p", "source_sha256": "b0954ecd5785bd2bc042f43634cd9c336e9e926ab22b4a0003dcdd2b580131db", "ja": "おはよう朋花。調子はどうだ？", "zh": "早上好，朋花。状态怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1042_031tom", "source_sha256": "9ac9a0746ee0ed13898671724653ed4a1dab531da8a7496bc723b03a606452e5", "ja": "当然、万全に整えてきましたよ～。\n朝のうちに、ひとつ報告をと思いまして～。", "zh": "那当然，状态已经调整到万全了哦～。\n我是想着趁着早上，来向您作个汇报的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "da6c468ae05ec874f680830fbdd710c8e3da913de2b808aaa49685a016f1656d", "ja": "なるほど。3人で毎晩オンライン通話を……\nそれはいいアイディアだな！", "zh": "原来如此。每晚和3个人在线通话……  \n这真是个好主意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1044_031tom", "source_sha256": "082b57dd8c2e3e1d3a436ca785eccafe20257ca992bf78f1f60d8b9147659fdd", "ja": "ええ、色々と話していますよ～。\nその上で、レッスンについて相談があるのですが～。", "zh": "是的，我们会聊各种各样的事情哦～  \n除此之外，我还想和您商量一下关于训练的事～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "ffd411ca595fbf782a0bf5b7edcc73176b5065f8758b03aab0a5b0a39614472f", "ja": "あ、レッスンについてなら、俺も相談したいことが\nあって……ちょっとこの書類を見てくれないか？", "zh": "啊，说到训练，我也有件事想商量……能请你看看这份文件吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1046_031tom", "source_sha256": "d57f8f487e0b107d315a9c7c980c7ca959bfe520697e7d00523d8ee13d8a7b00", "ja": "これは……スケジュール表ですか～。なるほど……。\n合同練習の時間を、個人練習にあてるんですね～？", "zh": "这是……日程表吗～。原来如此……。要把合练的时间用来个人练习吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1047_p", "source_sha256": "09453e6ec4e67721448d148d8529bdb8a32ced8d2547f49602b57b2e2a2db930", "ja": "あくまでプランのひとつだけど。無理に\n時間を合わせなくていいなら、余裕ができそうだから。", "zh": "这只是其中一个计划。不过如果不用勉强协调时间，应该就能轻松一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1048_031tom", "source_sha256": "7e4b9ef71b14a840fdaebe6a7d57855c2544c179efe2914fb92b95590e10ae0b", "ja": "ふふ……実は私も、\nそういう相談をしようと思っていたんですよ～。", "zh": "呵呵……其实我也正想和你商量这件事呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1049_p", "source_sha256": "826284994fe4988066daeea923de032165233fe857e912bd5c4d3774cfbec237", "ja": "え、そうだったのか？\nそれは……ふたりと話し合って？", "zh": "诶，原来是这样吗？\n也就是说……是和她们两个人商量过了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1050_031tom", "source_sha256": "27103cfcb7dc54048528d446d4d6119a61a61e9af95626cc111e366dbcedc675", "ja": "はい～、3人で決めたことです～。\n{$P$}さんも同じ意見とは……。", "zh": "是的～，这是由3个人共同决定的～。\n没想到连{$P$}先生也是同样的意见……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1051_031tom", "source_sha256": "673be72c69f93ade77017f6032e8b1cae002e293e9558eb6f1b2ce149129a69f", "ja": "プロデューサーとして、先回りができていますね～。\n褒めてあげましょう～♪", "zh": "作为制作人，您很会未雨绸缪呢～。\n值得表扬～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1052_p", "source_sha256": "b3463af9de7f2875ad3941224c543b5ee4f94cc238256a0f0acdbfe7239352a6", "ja": "でもこのプランだと、合わせの練習は、\n本番直前の一回だけだ……それでも、大丈夫か？", "zh": "不过按照这个计划，合练就只有正式演出前的那一次……这样真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1053_031tom", "source_sha256": "fd6c025f6930d2e446162a96b7f07f48aeafac9fc235f5123ab9dcb70646ace8", "ja": "愚問ですね～。覚悟なら、3人で決めました～。\n一回でぴったり合わせてみせますよ～。", "zh": "真是个愚蠢的问题呢～既然做好觉悟了，我们3人早就下定决心了～。\n一次就能完美配合给你看～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1054_031tom", "source_sha256": "70fee67ce94f88dc2b9bcdba305bd9d90b6ff731a0d492022ba4b9689c88ce04", "ja": "そうと決まれば、さっそくレッスンに行きましょう～。\n今日は聖母のために、尽くしてくださいね～？", "zh": "既然决定了，那就赶紧去上课吧～。今天请为圣母尽心尽力哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1055_p", "source_sha256": "9777d082daeed9e5fe0ebf78e34582641757543bbbb34ba030fea8d45313692e", "ja": "（思いもよらない形だったけど、\nユニット3人の結束は、固まりつつある）", "zh": "（虽然形式出乎意料，但这个由3人组成的组合，正在逐渐团结起来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_05_1056_p", "source_sha256": "d5edca802b6aa2fcfd4bf026bfa3b5d2fde45119be7b2be584373f010b337e93", "ja": "（たとえ集まれなくても、離れていても、\n彼女たちの想いはひとつだ。その想いを信じよう）", "zh": "（即使无法相聚，即使相隔两地，她们的心意也是一致的。相信这份心意吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
